ce ? Découvrez comment collaborer avec BonsPlansMania.fr : articles dédiés, codes promo exclusifs, affiliation.\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"bons plans beauté,tests produits gratuits,concours beauté,box beauté,réductions cosmétiques,codes promo beauté,échantillons gratuits\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Bons Plans Mania — Bons plans beauté &amp; tests gratuits\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Les meilleurs bons plans beauté, tests gratuits, concours et avis box beauté.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"BonsPlansMania\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"fr_FR\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/og-image.svg\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Bons Plans Mania — Bons plans beauté, tests gratuits et concours\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Bons Plans Mania — Bons plans beauté &amp; tests gratuits\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Les meilleurs bons plans beauté, tests gratuits, concours et avis box beauté.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/og-image.svg\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Bons Plans Mania — Bons plans beauté, tests gratuits et concours\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"32x32\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"poppins_5c7fdea4-module__KszEFa__className\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"header\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"header-inner\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"logo\">Bons Plans <span>Mania</span></a><nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"\">Accueil</a><a href=\"/categorie/bon-plan\" class=\"\">Bons Plans</a><div class=\"nav-dropdown\"><button class=\"nav-dropdown-toggle \">Tests Produits ▾</button></div><a href=\"/categorie/concours\" class=\"\">Concours</a><div class=\"nav-dropdown\"><button class=\"nav-dropdown-toggle \">Beauté ▾</button></div><a href=\"/blog\" class=\"nav-cta \">Tous les articles</a><a href=\"/recherche\" class=\"search-btn\" aria-label=\"Rechercher\" title=\"Rechercher\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:inherit;transition:background 0.2s\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></a></nav></div></div></header><main style=\"padding:64px 0;min-height:60vh\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"max-width:760px\"><h1 style=\"font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:16px\">Partenariats et collaborations</h1><p style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#6B7280;margin-bottom:48px;line-height:1.6\">Vous représentez une marque, une agence ou une plateforme d&#x27;affiliation ? Découvrez comment travailler avec Bons Plans Mania.</p><section style=\"margin-bottom:48px\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:20px\">Le site en quelques chiffres</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));gap:16px\"><div style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary)\">1811+</div><div style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#6B7280;margin-top:4px\">articles publiés</div></div><div style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary)\">SEO</div><div style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#6B7280;margin-top:4px\">1ère page Google sur plusieurs requêtes</div></div><div style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary)\">Quotidien</div><div style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#6B7280;margin-top:4px\">nouveau contenu chaque jour</div></div><div style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary)\">6+</div><div style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#6B7280;margin-top:4px\">catégories couvertes</div></div></div></section><section style=\"margin-bottom:48px\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px\">Nos thématiques</h2><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Beauté et cosmétiques</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Soins visage et corps</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">K-beauty</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Bio et naturel</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Box beauté</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Mode et accessoires</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Maison et bien-être</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Épicerie et alimentation</span></div></section><section style=\"margin-bottom:48px\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:20px\">Formats de collaboration</h2><div style=\"display:grid;gap:20px\"><div style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary)\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">Article dédié</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#6B7280;line-height:1.6;margin:0\">Un article complet et optimisé SEO autour de votre marque, vos produits ou votre offre en cours. Rédigé avec un ton authentique et publié dans la catégorie adaptée.</p></div><div style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary)\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">Code promo exclusif</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#6B7280;line-height:1.6;margin:0\">Un code promo réservé à notre audience, mis en avant dans un article dédié et référencé sur Google. Idéal pour générer du trafic qualifié et mesurer les conversions.</p></div><div style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary)\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">Affiliation</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#6B7280;line-height:1.6;margin:0\">Intégration de vos produits dans nos sélections, comparatifs et bons plans avec un suivi des performances via votre programme d&#x27;affiliation.</p></div><div style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary)\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">Test produit</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#6B7280;line-height:1.6;margin:0\">Présentation détaillée d&#x27;un produit avec un avis honnête, des photos et un lien direct vers votre site. Un format qui génère de la confiance auprès des lecteurs.</p></div></div></section><section style=\"margin-bottom:48px\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px\">Ils nous font déjà confiance</h2><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">L&#x27;Oreal</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Weleda</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Nuxe</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Garnier</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">CeraVe</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">NYX</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Maybelline</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Bioderma</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">La Roche-Posay</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Glowria</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Blissim</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Biotyfull</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Greenweez</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">YesStyle</span><span style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#374151\">Showroomprivee</span></div></section><section style=\"background:var(--primary);border-radius:16px;padding:40px;text-align:center;color:white\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px\">Travaillons ensemble</h2><p style=\"font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:24px;opacity:0.9\">Contactez-nous pour discuter d&#x27;un partenariat adapté à vos objectifs.</p><a href=\"mailto:bonsplansmania@gmail.com?subject=Partenariat%20BonsPlansMania\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:white;color:var(--primary);padding:14px 32px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;text-decoration:none\">bonsplansmania@gmail.com</a></section></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/ae6ea63e89c8827e.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[83681,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/cf200c391baea40a.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[83608,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/cf200c391baea40a.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/e18fb4d6afd30c8f.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/e90239902b00a299.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/829ba4228c966254-s.p.a61bc753.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":